Simulink Model
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
This Simulink Model aims to calculates the (Aerodynamic & Thrust) (Forces
 & Moments) acting on an Airplane due to pilots input signals ( 
\begin_inset Formula $\delta$
\end_inset

aileron , 
\begin_inset Formula $\delta$
\end_inset

rudder , 
\begin_inset Formula $\delta$
\end_inset

elevator , 
\begin_inset Formula $\delta$
\end_inset

thrust ) knowing its stability & control derivatives at nominal flight condition
 to validate the results of RK4 code.
\end_layout

