\begin_layout Standard
The Aircraft Model uses the states from RBD block multiplies them by the
 states matrix and multiplies the control inputs of the pilot by the controls
 matrix and multiplies by the mass and moments of inertia to get the delta
 forces and moments.
\end_layout

